    <itunes:duration>01:18:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/615f6cb1c8c1d14e83366a40/FncTKsuCTSgDEed5DkFvUj7D5Lpj.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>「鹅们聊聊」：润德国？先别急着走双元制！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c8327b52a6af799c77e6f7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c8327b52a6af799c77e6f7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Mar 2025 10:52:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>德国的双元制教育在中国很火，有些中介避重就轻，只告诉大家“做双元制可以在学技能的同时拿工资，毕业后无缝进入公司工作”简直为润人量身定做。但，真的是这样吗？任何工种你都能选择吗？无论谁都适合参加双元制职业教育吗？……</span></p><p><span>欢迎收听本期「鹅们聊聊」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> 德国职业教育的概述</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 双元制教育</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 学校制职业教育</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 培训津贴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 护理专业、牙医助理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 中途退出护理专业的姐妹的真实经历分享</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 如何选择适合自己的职业教育路径</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 学历与薪资的关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 自己适合双元制还是读本硕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 双元制工种推荐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 双元制语言水平要求</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> 建议</span></p><p><br></p><p><span>我们希望能够帮助你理清思路，让你冷静下来。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/615f6cb1c8c1d14e83366a40/limZ9ltBs4ur-3YIsH4VgxX5B74l.mp3" length="50971085" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:23</itunes:duration>
