  <item>
    <title>「鹅们聊聊」：学德语，慢慢来，比较快</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c8a3c6eb5d5cf5833bc61d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c8a3c6eb5d5cf5833bc61d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2024 14:38:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期播客的嘉宾是我的合伙人——Peppa 佩奇，她是一个留德多年的语言学人，当然也是我在推特上认识的女权姐妹。我忐忑地私信她是否有兴趣和我一起创办一家留德工作室，没想到她爽快地答应了！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>跑鹅德语已经成立1周年了，我们在这一年里帮助了几十位学员学习德语、备考德语考试和APS面试。佩奇也帮助学员申请预科，我也协助过有的姐妹申请双元制。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期播客我们主要聊了聊我俩的教学理念，初学者如何更高效地入门一门外语，佩奇谈了很多她学习德语经历和心得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对德语学习感兴趣的话，不妨听一听，也许能收获一些有用的小方法或是“颠覆”你对自学外语的认识。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> “跑鹅”的初心&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 德语考试-德福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 德语考试-DSH</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> 佩奇预科考试经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 佩奇预科介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 佩奇预科预科上课方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> DSH</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> 歌德考试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> Telc Hochschule-C1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 歌德考试-考试形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 学习德语的心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> 佩奇讲教材</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 学习德语的小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 先掌握发音规则再进阶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> 跑鹅的教学理念：基础阶段在专业老师的带领下入门，达到中级再自学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a> 德语语法特点、实例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 到了中级以后怎么有效提高德语呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">26:39</a> 语言学习窗口期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> 青少年适用自然学习法，成年人不可</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a> 外语学习大杀器：听写！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a> 尚雯婕外语学习法 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BAnktaOCbqZ0Dx6x_QkDXQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BAnktaOCbqZ0Dx6x_QkDXQ"><span>【鹅的干货系列】播客篇</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2026">33:46</a> 佩奇类似的学习经历： 以B1水平做字幕组的工作，德语突飞猛进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> 关于教学，我们谈到了教材 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xPAy2aWEYtXeSnRyg9B0wQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xPAy2aWEYtXeSnRyg9B0wQ"><span>【干货】自学德语，教材怎么选？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2595">43:15</a> 语法点分散的教材，我的处理方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2611">43:31</a> 教材对比总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2630">43:50</a> 成年人用自然学习法效率很低，成年人入门外语直接学语法规则 才高效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> 什么时候用自然学习法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2749">45:49</a> 给成年人的高效入门外语的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 跑鹅德语原创半自学会员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a> “我有免费的ChatGPT为什么还要买跑鹅的会员？” 什么时候用它更好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 什么语言水平可以用ChatGPT呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">51:36</a> 自学，慢慢来比较快</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3218">53:38</a> 语法书 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/71fcx64QWkB8wqP28uf_JQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/71fcx64QWkB8wqP28uf_JQ"><span>【干货】自学德语，语法书怎么选？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3245">54:05</a> 放平心态，慢慢来，不要被别人影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">55:05</a> 总结， call back 「房间自语」：学更多德语，看更大世界。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/615f6cb1c8c1d14e83366a40/lkEkEMlag69FKc9fqghUba7GbqwS.mp4a" length="55961307" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/615f6cb1c8c1d14e83366a40/FncTKsuCTSgDEed5DkFvUj7D5Lpj.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>「我的朋友们」：不就是在德国工作嘛，姐妹拿下它！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6683164e96efcf17f8d32d12</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6683164e96efcf17f8d32d12</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jul 2024 18:17:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于！常常打视频电话的我们仨一起录播客了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>她俩是我来德国后在推特上认识、在柏林的线下女权活动中面基成功的</span></p><span></span><p><span>基女姐妹！</span></p><span></span><p><span>一位是学艺术/设计，毕业后20多天就找到工作的路德维;一位是学工</span></p><span></span><p><span>科，还未毕业就锁定职位的老鲨。（超蒂吧！）</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">7:10</a> </span><strong><span>老鲨的工作经历：Hiwi、在大公司实习后转正</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">9:59</a> </span><strong><span>我们三人的学科背景</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> </span><strong><span>奖学金经历</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> </span><strong><span>吐槽德国的个税</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> </span><strong><span>小吴的各种打工经历</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 路德维的</span><strong><span>在德找工作经历</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> 老鲨</span><strong><span>的</span></strong><span>在德</span><strong><span>找工作经历， Networking帮了大忙</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> </span><strong><span>管它什么多少年工作经验，投</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1411">23:31</a> </span><strong><span>喜欢就去投，可以进入人才库</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> </span><strong><span>Jobmesse</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">27:17</a> </span><strong><span>艺术设计类找工作、逛设计展、设计行业特点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a> </span><strong><span>在德工作体验</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1796">29:56</a> 老鲨谈</span><strong><span>中德对比</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 在德</span><strong><span>不用害怕犯错、有Work&amp;Life Balance</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1866">31:06</a> </span><strong><span>在国内工作感觉没有被尊重</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> </span><strong><span>低语境语社会 vs. 高语境</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> </span><strong><span>当然德国职场也有很烂的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2181">36:21</a> </span><strong><span>总结</span></strong></p><span></span><p><br></p>]]></description>
