  <item>
    <title>「房间自语」：重启人生之德国本科真是有点难</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65493caa60e60e73a5df3337</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65493caa60e60e73a5df3337</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Nov 2023 18:52:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>按下人生“重启键”的我来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期开头我分享了一下我了解到的德国新《技术移民法》的亮点，声明：我不是法律专业的，只是做字面上的解读。新法案反映了德国非常缺人，尤其是IT、护理行业！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 德本好难啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 退旧房，退房时被坑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> “凡发生必有利于我” 经验教训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 感谢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">30:48</a> 既然已经重启人生，何不对自己宽容一些，换一种活法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a> 德本就读体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a> 做了这个决定我才真正成为了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">39:23</a> 女人们，进入科技领域吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> 德本课程设置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">45:01</a> 再强调一遍，年龄不是问题！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>写作业去了😭</span></p>]]></description>
